Choosing the assignee field in interactive create and declining self-assignment overrides LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASSIGN_SELF=always.
-- env --
LINEAR_TEAM_KEY=ENG
LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASSIGN_SELF=always
-- tty --
expect What's the title of your issue?
send Interactive assignee override\r
expect Description
send \r
expect What's next?
send \e[B\r
expect Select additional fields to configure
send \e[B \r
expect Press ↵ again to submit
send \r
expect Assign this issue to yourself?
send \r
-- run --
linear issue create
-- stdout --
{{*}}✓ Created issue ENG-1: Interactive assignee override
https://linear.app/kadoraba/issue/ENG-1/interactive-assignee-override
ENG-1 has no --project or --parent.{{*}}
-- state.json --
{"Issue": [{"title": "Interactive assignee override", "assignee": null}]}
